            "review_title": "Review at Zesty",
            "review_text": "cathy1506\nAdelaide, Australia31 contributions\n1\nGreat bar\nMar 2019 • Couples\nSpent a few days in Saigon found this great bar. Great drinks and fab staff. Sitting chatting to a woman nursing a kitten asked what she did turns out she was the owner. Just off the Main Street . Has hostel above the bar but not related to the bar. Just has a shared entrance. Just starting out so support the bar and staff\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 4, 2019\nGlenna C\nDear friends,\n\nGlad to chatting with you and hope everything goes well with you :D\nRead more\nWritten March 8, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
