            "review_title": "Review at Zesty",
            "review_text": "bb1011\nSunderland, United Kingdom34 contributions\n1\nA warm welcome and tasty food\nJan 2019 • Couples\nWe called into Zesty for a light meal at lunchtime, and found a very warm welcome, and despite not speaking any Vietnamese, managed to find a meal which was tasty, healthy and suited both a meat eater and one who rarely eats meat. Kebabs with bbq beef, ( and bbq veg) and noodles in a rich soup, at a very reasonable price. The staff are very helpful and friendly. An enjoyable experience!\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2019\nGlenna C\nDear friends,\n\nThanks for your visiting :D and hope we can meet again in near future :D :D\nRead more\nWritten March 8, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
